        "native_id": "9xgb018fnpl2",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "We are investigating an issue affecting audit log delivery for WARP API. Audit logs for some customers may be delayed or not delivered, and some dependent services may also be affected.\n\nWe have identified the cause as a capacity problem in a shared internal data pipeline in our PDX region. Mitigations are in place and the pipeline is partially recovered. We are continuing to monitor and work toward full recovery.",
